	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"月刊ガンダムエース「機動戦士ガンダムSEED Xアストレイ」に登場する「ジンハイマニューバ」の1/144HG仕様のプラモデル。「機動戦士ガンダムSEED」に登場した「ジン」を改良し、高機動タイプにバージョンアップした機体です。胸部や肩部など、各部に増加パーツを追加しています。武器は重斬刀を取り付けできる新デザインのビームライフルが付属します。"
		],
		"en": [
			"A 1/144HG plastic model of the \"Jinhai Maneuver\" that appears in Gundam Ace's \"Mobile Suit GundamSEED X Astray\". This aircraft is an improved version of the \"Jin\" that appeared in \"Mobile Suit GundamSEED\" and has been upgraded to a high-mobility type. Additional parts have been added to each part, such as the chest and shoulders. The weapon comes with a newly designed beam rifle that can be equipped with a heavy sword."
		]
	},
